  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "國際經營與貿易研究專題",
    "sub_ename": " INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS RESEARCH PROJECT",
    "describe_ch": "增加學士班學生對於研究的認識，並介紹研究的基本元素，包括研究的邏輯架構和文字與口說溝通的型式。透過本課程，學生將更加了解研究的程序、研究的類型、以及研究者需要的技巧。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed to complement the undergraduate research experience and to introduce undergraduate students to the basic elements of research, including the logical framework of research and forms of written and verbal communication. Through the course, students will gain an understanding of the research process, the types of research, and the skills needed by researchers.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
